    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Please excuse if I missed some obvious changes to the functionality of radioButtons() or the shiny package in general.<div><br></div><div>After updating to the latest dev build of shiny I encounter the following problem:</div><div><br></div><div>The radioButtons() returns NULL when a shiny app is started, instead of the value determined by the &quot;selected&quot; parameter. </div><div>Even updateRadioButtons(session, ...) does not work and NULL is returned. Only manually clicking the radioButtons once does the trick.</div><div><br></div><div>This bevahiour breaks all logical statements as the length of input$radiobuttons is of length zero initially.</div><div><br></div><div>All packages are up-to-date. Session Info below.</div><div><br></div><div>Best</div><div><br></div><div>Christoph</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">R version </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3.1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2014</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">31</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Platform</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> x86_64</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">w64</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mingw32</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x64 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">64</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">bit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>locale</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> LC_COLLATE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#606\">English_United</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Kingdom</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1252</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  LC_CTYPE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#606\">English_United</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Kingdom</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1252</span><span style=\"color:#000\">    LC_MONETARY</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#606\">English_United</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Kingdom</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1252</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> LC_NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">C                           <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> LC_TIME</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#606\">English_United</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Kingdom</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1252</span><span style=\"color:#000\">    <br><br><br>attached </span><span style=\"color:#008\">base</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> packages</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> stats     graphics  grDevices utils     datasets  methods   </span><span style=\"color:#008\">base</span><span style=\"color:#000\">     <br><br><br>other attached packages</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> shinysky_0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.2</span><span style=\"color:#000\">    plyr_1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">8.1</span><span style=\"color:#000\">        RJSONIO_1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#000\">     shiny_0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10.2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">9006</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>loaded via a </span><span style=\"color:#008\">namespace</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">and</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">not</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> attached</span><span style=\"color:#660\">):</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> digest_0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6.6</span><span style=\"color:#000\">    htmltools_0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2.6</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> httpuv_1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3.2</span><span style=\"color:#000\">    mime_0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#000\">        R6_2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#000\">        </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Rcpp_0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">11.3</span><span style=\"color:#000\">     tools_3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.2</span><span style=\"color:#000\">     xtable_1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">7</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">4</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div></div>"
    ]
